  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would provide self-contained residential units within the curtilage of existing houses and would be in conflict with other Local Plan policies. The proposal would be unacceptable in principle and would fail to comply with Local Plan policy SC1.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed development due to its inappropriate massing, scale, and design would fail to respond to the character and context of the surrounding area. The proposal would be contrary to London Plan Policies D4 and D6, and Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2 and SC4.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposed development would result in an increased level of activity, noise and disturbance and loss of privacy to neighbouring properties. This harm to neighbouring properties would be contrary to Local Plan policy CC2.",
    "Reason : 4 - The proposed development would deliver a substandard quality of accommodation, particularly in respect of quality of outlook and private external amenity space and a failure to demonstrate adequate daylight and sunlight to all units. The proposal would therefore fail to comply with London Plan policy D6 and Local Plan policy SC5.",
    "Reason : 5 - The application has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would have an acceptable impact on the local highway and not result in additional excessive parking stress on the roads surrounding the development. The proposed development is therefore contrary to Local Plan policy EC2."
  ],
